### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/health

### Heartbeat (DS)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/internal/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-token: dev-change-me-internal-service-token

{
  "playerCount": 1,
  "status": "online"
}

### Checkpoint (DS)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/internal/world/checkpoint
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-token: dev-change-me-internal-service-token

{
  "dirtyActorCount": 3,
  "dataBase64": "d29ybGQtc3RhdGUtdjE="
}

### Restore latest (DS boot)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/internal/world/restore-latest
x-internal-token: dev-change-me-internal-service-token
